{"id":"vod_sn_38584","vodId":"38584","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"阿滋漫画大王","name_cn":"阿滋漫画大王","date":"2002-01-01","year":"2002","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/37f079b6c8a4795eb76a60ef617fadbf.jpg"},"summary":"这一天，班上转来了两个学生，一个是跳级生美滨千代（金田朋子 配音），她拥有着和可爱外表完全不匹配的天才级智商，以及同智商完全不匹配的情商。另一个叫春日步（松冈由贵 配音），她倒是表里如一的迟钝和呆萌。很快，她们便和同学们打成了一片。泷野智（樋口智惠子 配音）人称阿智，争强好斗的同时，却有着意外的单纯和天真。外表冷静成熟的榊（浅川悠 配音）对世上一切可爱的东西抵抗力为零。水原历（田中理惠 配音）是阿智的童年玩伴，成绩优秀的她毫无疑问的成为了阿智的挑战对象。再加上一个活宝班主任谷崎由佳里（平松晶子 配音），这三年的高中生活一定会多姿多彩的。　　动画片由漫画家东清彦的同名四格漫画改编，用过描绘女子高中生的日常，展现了一个可爱温暖，妙趣横生的世界。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:02:49","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/5xUvtyrTRY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/zZkU9XZKSp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/F2ZwfjDyQc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/PK6hjNv89e1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/KQPYSzEsrr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/h8H516kwDz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/KtPAZacQfm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/6Dm29krSEu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/YNMs3E5hig1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/dPfqxF0LP01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Ran0fbhNAG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/JJnDUHyrgD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/f8s61wUBrB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/JeAsD